### 1.3 Create Email Templates (src/worker/email/templates/)
Create template files for each notification type with fr/en variants:

**password-reset.ts:**
- Subject fr: "Réinitialisation de votre mot de passe Secure360"
- Subject en: "Reset your Secure360 password"
- Body includes reset link (valid 1 hour) and security warning

**critical-incident-alert.ts:**
- Subject fr: "Alerte : Incident critique #{reference}"
- Subject en: "Alert: Critical incident #{reference}"
- Body includes severity, category label (localized), time, and dashboard link

**token-reuse-alert.ts:**
